Note on the captured market data committed under notebooks/sample_data/: it was
recorded from Binance's public market-data streams, which carry their own terms
of use. It is included so the demo runs without an exchange account, and it is
three short sessions of publicly broadcast BTCUSDT depth data from 2026-07-27.
